   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Appointment Request",
   "class": "section-heading"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The first step towards a beautiful, healthy smile is to schedule an appointment. Please contact our office by phone or complete the appointment request form below. Our scheduling coordinator will contact you to confirm your appointment."
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Consultation Hours:\nMonday and Tuesday: 8:00am - 5:00pm\nWednesday: Closed\nThursday: 8:00am - 5:00pm\nFriday: 8:00am - 1:00pm\nSaturday and Sunday: Closed\n24/7 emergency services are available.",
   "md": "**Consultation Hours:**\nMonday and Tuesday: 8:00am - 5:00pm\nWednesday: Closed\nThursday: 8:00am - 5:00pm\nFriday: 8:00am - 1:00pm\nSaturday and Sunday: Closed\n24/7 emergency services are available."
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Please do not use this form to cancel or change an existing appointment.",
   "md": "*Please do not use this form to cancel or change an existing appointment.*"
  },
